# Mandatory verification after every change

Do not finish a coding turn until both succeed:

1. `npx tsc --noEmit` — zero errors.
2. Focused Vitest for touched areas (`pnpm exec vitest run <files>`). If the change is cross-cutting (auth, middleware, catalog, pricing), run those test files together.

If tsc or tests fail, fix them in the same turn. Do not skip because the change “looks small.”
